    (5446, N'Enable or Disable Settings Based on Another Option', N'EnableDisableProperties.cs', N'C#', N'Indicator', N'disable setting,enable setting,read only,conditional setting,PropertyDescriptor', N'[RefreshProperties(RefreshProperties.All)]
[Display(Name = "Lock value")]
public bool LockValue
{ get; set; }

[Display(Name = "Period")]
public int Period
{ get; set; }

public class ReadOnlyDescriptor : PropertyDescriptor
{
    private readonly PropertyDescriptor property;
    private readonly bool isReadOnly;

    public ReadOnlyDescriptor(
        PropertyDescriptor property,
        bool isReadOnly)
        : base(property.Name, property.Attributes.OfType<Attribute>().ToArray())
    {
        this.property = property;
        this.isReadOnly = isReadOnly;
    }

    public override bool IsReadOnly
    {
        get { return isReadOnly; }
    }

    public override object GetValue(object component)
    {
        return property.GetValue(component);
    }

    public override void SetValue(object component, object value)
    {
        property.SetValue(component, value);
    }

    public override Type ComponentType => property.ComponentType;
    public override Type PropertyType => property.PropertyType;
    public override bool CanResetValue(object component) => false;
    public override void ResetValue(object component) { }
    public override bool ShouldSerializeValue(object component) => true;
